<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Let Me Know"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Playlist - EP"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPU901901790"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1537779208"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Akira Sunset &amp; Toshinobu Kubota</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">为何偏偏要找我搭话？ 为什么是我</text><text for="L2">明明杯盏满桌 谈笑满屋</text><text for="L3">「休息日你都怎么过？」</text><text for="L4">「看电影？ 我也很喜欢呢」</text><text for="L5">明明该是简单的问题 却答不上来</text><text for="L6">看我一眼 却又别靠太近</text><text for="L7">并不是完全没有期待</text><text for="L8">虽然还捉摸不透 却好想听你亲口说</text><text for="L9">从你嘴里说出一句「好可爱」</text><text for="L10">想多了解你一点</text><text for="L11">却又不想被你看穿心思</text><text for="L12">唯独你的真心教人看不清</text><text for="L13">按捺不住的心跳</text><text for="L14">亲爱的 告诉我你的心意吧</text><text for="L15">或许真的好想听你说「好可爱」</text><text for="L16">忽然不声不响 坐到了我身旁</text><text for="L17">害得我连补口红都顾不上 刘海也是···</text><text for="L18">「有男朋友吗？单身多久了？」</text><text for="L19">「你喜欢什么样的类型？」</text><text for="L20">要是再这样在意下去 可就不妙了</text><text for="L21">朝我看来 却又别靠太近</text><text for="L22">仿佛连心思都要被你彻底看穿</text><text for="L23">虽然还捉摸不透 却好想听你说</text><text for="L24">从你嘴里说出一句「真可爱」</text><text for="L25">想更靠近你一些</text><text for="L26">却又不想露出半点破绽</text><text for="L27">唯独你的心意我捉摸不透</text><text for="L28">悸动不已的心跳</text><text for="L29">亲爱的 告诉我你的真心好吗</text><text for="L30">好想听你夸我「好可爱」</text><text for="L31">「差不多到时间了呢」</text><text for="L32">「待会儿打算怎样？要回家了吗？」</text><text for="L33">如果在这里说了再见 就再也见不到了吗？</text><text for="L34">看向我吧 却又别靠太近</text><text for="L35">愈发汹涌的情意 根本按捺不住</text><text for="L36">其实好想索性说出口</text><text for="L37">对你说「我还想再见到你」</text><text for="L38">渴望将你了解更深</text><text for="L39">却又不想暴露自己的心意</text><text for="L40">唯独你的真心始终看不清</text><text for="L41">心口狂跳不止</text><text for="L42">亲爱的 快点告诉我吧</text><text for="L43">最想听你夸我一句「好可爱」</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:29.973"><div begin="0:18.342" end="3:29.973"><p begin="0:18.342" end="0:26.252" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.342" end="0:18.812">どう</span><span begin="0:19.742" end="0:20.152">し</span><span begin="0:20.152" end="0:20.592">て</span> <span begin="0:21.092" end="0:21.632">声</span><span begin="0:21.632" end="0:21.832">か</span><span begin="0:21.832" end="0:22.122">け</span><span begin="0:22.122" end="0:22.312">て</span><span begin="0:22.312" end="0:22.772">く</span><span begin="0:22.772" end="0:23.122">る</span><span begin="0:23.122" end="0:23.512">の？</span> <span begin="0:24.162" end="0:24.302">な</span><span begin="0:24.302" end="0:24.422">ん</span><span begin="0:24.422" end="0:24.672">で</span><span begin="0:24.672" end="0:25.322">私</span><span begin="0:25.322" end="0:25.802">な</span><span begin="0:25.802" end="0:26.252">の</span></p><p begin="0:26.252" end="0:34.152" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.252" end="0:26.392">グ</span><span begin="0:26.392" end="0:26.802">ラ</span><span begin="0:27.712" end="0:28.152">ス</span><span begin="0:28.152" end="0:28.542">も</span><span begin="0:29.102" end="0:29.872">会話</span><span begin="0:29.872" end="0:30.072">も</span> <span begin="0:30.072" end="0:30.412">こ</span><span begin="0:30.412" end="0:30.762">ん</span><span begin="0:30.762" end="0:31.162">な</span><span begin="0:31.162" end="0:31.502">に</span><span begin="0:32.142" end="0:32.742">並</span><span begin="0:32.742" end="0:32.852">ん</span><span begin="0:32.852" end="0:33.162">で</span><span begin="0:33.162" end="0:33.302">る</span><span begin="0:33.302" end="0:33.802">の</span><span begin="0:33